{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SeedRequest"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A game draws every random value — combat rolls, roaming actors, ","type":"text"},{"code":"oneOf","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"prose — from one seeded stream (","type":"text"},{"code":"WorldState\/rngState","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), so pinning the seed","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"makes a whole session replay identically. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"play(_:_:seed:)"},{"text":" already does","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that in the test suite; this is the same knob for a built binary, so a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"transcript a tester records by hand becomes a reproducer someone else can","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"replay.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"It is also what the suite’s own ","type":"text"},{"code":"cachedWorld","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" falls back to for a ","type":"text"},{"code":"play","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"call that pins no seed, which is what makes ","type":"text"},{"code":"GNUSTO_SEED=7 swift test","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reproducible and a sweep across seeds able to find tests that only pass by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"luck. See "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/TestingYourGame"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A bad value is reported rather than ignored. The variable exists for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},